WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.639 --> 00:00:02.360
- Don't you just love Christmas?

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.592
- Come on man, you don't actually believe

00:00:03.592 --> 00:00:05.600
in Christmas do you?

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.075
Another round of shots please.

00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:08.132
- No, not for me.

00:00:08.132 --> 00:00:09.037
- Typical.

00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:10.418
- Yo, what's your problem been man?

00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:12.554
- You've abandoned me for some girl.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.900
You couldn't walk a mile in my shoes.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.654
- You think my shoes are just easy to walk

00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:16.706
a mile in?

00:00:16.706 --> 00:00:18.475
You and your stupid hat.

00:00:18.475 --> 00:00:19.856
Merry Christmas.

00:00:19.856 --> 00:00:23.803
(slow soothing music)

00:00:23.803 --> 00:00:26.196
(gasps) I wish he only knew.

00:00:27.855 --> 00:00:30.367
(swooshing sound)

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:35.441
(slow soothing music)

00:00:39.093 --> 00:00:40.733
(screaming)

00:00:41.569 --> 00:00:42.331
- I'm you.

00:00:42.331 --> 00:00:43.235
- You're me.

00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:45.373
- [Together] Did we just freaky Friday?

00:00:45.373 --> 00:00:47.308
(screaming)

00:00:47.308 --> 00:00:48.554
- Dude it's Christmas Eve.

00:00:48.554 --> 00:00:49.714
I was supposed to meet Sandra's parents

00:00:49.714 --> 00:00:51.015
for dinner tonight.

00:00:51.015 --> 00:00:52.129
Now you have to go.

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:53.070
- Christmas doesn't exist.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.056
I don't know anything about it.

00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:55.735
- I'll help you.

00:00:56.275 --> 00:00:57.713
- Fine.

00:00:57.713 --> 00:01:01.253
(upbeat music)

00:01:01.253 --> 00:01:02.791
- Do not mess this up, Justin.

00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:04.412
- Zach relax, I got this.

00:01:04.412 --> 00:01:04.976
- Check.

00:01:04.976 --> 00:01:05.902
- Ah, yeah.

00:01:05.902 --> 00:01:08.723
- Oh and there's one tiny
thing I forgot to mention.

00:01:08.723 --> 00:01:10.515
Her dad is Santa Clause.

00:01:10.515 --> 00:01:11.666
- Daddy this is Zach.

00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:13.293
- Hello Mr. Clause.

00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:15.150
- Sandra tells me you've
been having some problems

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:16.735
with your friend.

00:01:16.735 --> 00:01:17.611
- Zach told you that?

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:19.051
- Of course you told me that.

00:01:19.051 --> 00:01:20.165
You tell me everything.

00:01:20.165 --> 00:01:22.399
- What else have I told you then?

00:01:22.399 --> 00:01:24.148
- Finally alone.

00:01:24.148 --> 00:01:26.645
- Don't you dare kiss her.

00:01:26.645 --> 00:01:27.432
- Uh, what's that?

00:01:27.432 --> 00:01:29.011
- Mistletoe, duh.

00:01:29.011 --> 00:01:30.700
Why are you acting so weird?

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.307
- Excuse me we got some reindeer
illegally parked outside.

00:01:33.307 --> 00:01:34.816
(laughs)
- Ryan.

00:01:34.816 --> 00:01:36.800
- Ryan?
- Ryan?

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.328
What the hell is Sandra's
ex boyfriend Ryan

00:01:39.328 --> 00:01:40.595
doing in there?

00:01:40.595 --> 00:01:42.102
- His family's spending
the holidays in Europe

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.391
so we invited him.

00:01:43.391 --> 00:01:45.057
Hopefully he won't act as weird as you.

00:01:45.057 --> 00:01:46.166
- Ryan loves Europe.

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:48.267
Why wouldn't he go with them?

00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:50.694
This Christmas drink's pretty hot.

00:01:52.514 --> 00:01:56.010
- More like chestnuts
roasting on an open fire.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:59.627
(laughs)

00:02:00.897 --> 00:02:02.566
- [Santa] Merry Christmas to all

00:02:02.566 --> 00:02:05.518
and to all a goodnight.

00:02:05.518 --> 00:02:06.919
What the bell?

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:10.018
(screaming)

00:02:10.018 --> 00:02:12.810
- Santa (gasps).

00:02:13.674 --> 00:02:14.948
Yo, Santa's been kidnapped.

00:02:14.948 --> 00:02:16.496
- Justin?
- Justin?

00:02:16.496 --> 00:02:17.636
- Zach?

00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:19.038
I mean, Justin?

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:21.424
- Holy Hanukkah (screams).

00:02:21.424 --> 00:02:22.602
- We have to save Santa.

00:02:22.602 --> 00:02:23.281
- [Voiceover] We know where Santa is.

00:02:23.281 --> 00:02:25.557
The building is going to be guarded.

00:02:25.557 --> 00:02:26.363
- Hey.

00:02:26.363 --> 00:02:28.217
(alarm sounding)

00:02:28.217 --> 00:02:29.661
- Why are you putting us in so much danger

00:02:29.661 --> 00:02:31.191
over a stupid made up holiday?

00:02:31.191 --> 00:02:32.860
- Is this really about Christmas

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:34.346
or are you just jealous of me and Sandra?

00:02:34.346 --> 00:02:35.142
- Unbelievable.

00:02:35.142 --> 00:02:37.183
- I'm sorry I found
happiness and you're still

00:02:37.183 --> 00:02:38.332
by yourself.

00:02:38.332 --> 00:02:39.853
- I thought you were my best friend.

00:02:39.853 --> 00:02:42.467
- Why don't you just grow up, Justin?

00:02:43.357 --> 00:02:44.719
- Oh my God, Santa.

00:02:44.719 --> 00:02:46.261
Who did this to you?

00:02:46.261 --> 00:02:49.752
- Ho, ho, ho.

00:02:49.752 --> 00:02:51.331
- Ryan why are you doing this?

00:02:51.331 --> 00:02:53.873
- Whoever wears the fat bastard's hat

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:58.053
at midnight on Christmas
Eve becomes Santa.

00:02:58.053 --> 00:02:59.469
That's why I'm doing it.

00:02:59.469 --> 00:03:02.173
And that's why I dated Sandra.

00:03:02.173 --> 00:03:03.439
- But I love her.

00:03:03.439 --> 00:03:04.977
- You do?

00:03:04.977 --> 00:03:06.091
- Yeah man.

00:03:06.091 --> 00:03:09.971
- It looks like it's ho,
ho, hoes before bros.

00:03:09.971 --> 00:03:12.192
(laughing)

00:03:15.412 --> 00:03:17.498
(intense music)

00:03:17.498 --> 00:03:19.645
- [Santa] You'll have to work together.

00:03:19.645 --> 00:03:20.778
(intense music)

00:03:20.778 --> 00:03:22.571
A great friendship is something you have

00:03:22.571 --> 00:03:24.038
to fight for.

00:03:24.818 --> 00:03:26.435
Never forget that.

00:03:26.435 --> 00:03:27.817
(intense music)

00:03:27.817 --> 00:03:29.959
Believe in each other.

00:03:30.749 --> 00:03:32.733
Believe in Christmas.

00:03:32.733 --> 00:03:33.943
- It's too late, Santa.

00:03:33.943 --> 00:03:35.436
- [Santa] It's never too late Zach.

00:03:35.436 --> 00:03:36.738
- How'd you know I'm Zach?

00:03:36.738 --> 00:03:39.294
- He sees you when you're sleeping.

00:03:39.294 --> 00:03:40.525
- You believe.

00:03:40.525 --> 00:03:41.810
- I believe.

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:44.689
(upbeat music)

00:03:44.689 --> 00:03:47.332
(screaming)

00:03:47.332 --> 00:03:48.647
- I'm me again.

00:03:48.647 --> 00:03:51.445
- (laughs) I believe this belongs to me.

00:03:51.445 --> 00:03:54.011
(laughs)

00:03:54.011 --> 00:03:56.009
- Santa, what are we
going to do with Ryan?

00:03:56.009 --> 00:03:58.432
- [Santa] You leave
that little bitch to me.

00:03:58.432 --> 00:04:01.133
(upbeat music)

00:04:01.133 --> 00:04:03.866
Here comes Santa Clause.

00:04:03.866 --> 00:04:06.247
(upbeat music)

00:04:06.247 --> 00:04:09.087
♫ Come on, come on, come on

00:04:09.087 --> 00:04:10.782
♫ Oh yeah

00:04:11.492 --> 00:04:14.205
♫ Oh yeah, yeah, yeah ♫

00:04:15.928 --> 00:04:17.133
- But I have to go, I have to pee.

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:18.265
- No, absolutely not.

00:04:18.265 --> 00:04:19.932
I'm not going to have you look at my, no.

00:04:19.932 --> 00:04:21.442
- Then what do you propose?

00:04:21.442 --> 00:04:22.893
- Don't even think about looking at it.

00:04:22.893 --> 00:04:23.834
- I'm not looking.

00:04:23.834 --> 00:04:25.122
God, are you almost done?

00:04:25.122 --> 00:04:26.643
- You have a way bigger bladder than I do.

00:04:26.643 --> 00:04:27.725
(knocking)

00:04:27.725 --> 00:04:29.035
(screaming)

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:32.849
(upbeat music)

